   "title": "The pronoun charts",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"refh\">Direct and indirect</h3>\n<div class=\"tblwrap\"><table class=\"ref\">\n  <thead><tr><th>English</th><th>Direct</th><th>Indirect</th><th>With a preposition</th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>me</td><td class=\"c1\">mi</td><td class=\"c2\">mi</td><td>a me</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>you</td><td class=\"c1\">ti</td><td class=\"c2\">ti</td><td>a te</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>him / it (m)</td><td class=\"c1\">lo</td><td class=\"c2\">gli</td><td>a lui</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>her / it (f)</td><td class=\"c1\">la</td><td class=\"c2\">le</td><td>a lei</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>you (formal)</td><td class=\"c1\">La</td><td class=\"c2\">Le</td><td>a Lei</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>us</td><td class=\"c1\">ci</td><td class=\"c2\">ci</td><td>a noi</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>you all</td><td class=\"c1\">vi</td><td class=\"c2\">vi</td><td>a voi</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>them (m)</td><td class=\"c1\">li</td><td class=\"c2\">gli</td><td>a loro</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>them (f)</td><td class=\"c1\">le</td><td class=\"c2\">gli</td><td>a loro</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p class=\"reftip\">Quick test: if there is an <b>a</b> before the person (Telefono <b>a</b> Maria), it's indirect. No <b>a</b> (Vedo Maria), it's direct.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"refh\">Possessives</h3>\n<div class=\"tblwrap\"><table class=\"ref\">\n  <thead><tr><th></th><th>m. sing.</th><th>f. sing.</th><th>m. plural</th><th>f. plural</th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>my</td><td class=\"c3\">il mio</td><td class=\"c3\">la mia</td><td class=\"c3\">i miei</td><td class=\"c3\">le mie</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>your</td><td class=\"c3\">il tuo</td><td class=\"c3\">la tua</td><td class=\"c3\">i tuoi</td><td class=\"c3\">le tue</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>his / her / your (Lei)</td><td class=\"c3\">il suo</td><td class=\"c3\">la sua</td><td class=\"c3\">i suoi</td><td class=\"c3\">le sue</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>our</td><td class=\"c3\">il nostro</td><td class=\"c3\">la nostra</td><td class=\"c3\">i nostri</td><td class=\"c3\">le nostre</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>your (all)</td><td class=\"c3\">il vostro</td><td class=\"c3\">la vostra</td><td class=\"c3\">i vostri</td><td class=\"c3\">le vostre</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>their</td><td class=\"c3\">il loro</td><td class=\"c3\">la loro</td><td class=\"c3\">i loro</td><td class=\"c3\">le loro</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p class=\"reftip\">The ending matches the <b>thing</b>, not the owner. Drop the article for one family member (<b>mia</b> sorella), keep it for plurals (<b>i miei</b> genitori) and always with <b>loro</b>.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"refh\">This and that</h3>\n<div class=\"tblwrap\"><table class=\"ref\">\n  <thead><tr><th>Article</th><th>this / these</th><th>that / those</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>il</td><td class=\"c4\">questo</td><td class=\"c4\">quel</td><td>quel pane</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>lo</td><td class=\"c4\">questo</td><td class=\"c4\">quello</td><td>quello yogurt</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>l'</td><td class=\"c4\">quest'</td><td class=\"c4\">quell'</td><td>quell'olio</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>la</td><td class=\"c4\">questa</td><td class=\"c4\">quella</td><td>quella fetta</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>i</td><td class=\"c4\">questi</td><td class=\"c4\">quei</td><td>quei panini</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>gli</td><td class=\"c4\">questi</td><td class=\"c4\">quegli</td><td>quegli affettati</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>le</td><td class=\"c4\">queste</td><td class=\"c4\">quelle</td><td>quelle bottiglie</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p class=\"reftip\">Quello copies the article: qu<b>el</b> ↔ <b>il</b>, que<b>i</b> ↔ <b>i</b>, que<b>gli</b> ↔ <b>gli</b>.</p>"
  }
